    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0008:0001",
      "source": "You may set the value of a capture device’s [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) in two ways:",
      "ko": "캡처 장치의 [`activeFormat`](avcapturedevice/activeformat.md) 값은 두 가지 방식으로 설정할 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "0983800db621bf3dd53ec9412d99c63b5945ad211581aa1059afc2d6dbd6c3de",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0001",
      "source": "Set it directly using one of the formats in the device’s [`formats`](avcapturedevice/formats.md) property.",
      "ko": "장치의 [`formats`](avcapturedevice/formats.md) 속성에 있는 형식 중 하나를 직접 사용해 직접 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "a689f1f1f94a68102f6fb7912d288d416b048f1d237e027c837ea8791ed707c6",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:list:discussion:0009:0002",
      "source": "The capture session sets it on your behalf when you set its [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) property.",
      "ko": "캡처 세션은 [`sessionPreset`](avcapturesession/sessionpreset.md) 속성을 설정할 때 이를 대신 설정합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "cbd3d2f74371bc4026f7ba00c50cfeb58eede501a0e0e0ab2852e8d406d18715",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "source": "Depending on the device and format, you may configure the default auto exposure behavior differently when you use one method or the other, resulting in non-uniform auto exposure behavior.",
      "ko": "기기 및 형식에 따라 한 방법을 사용하거나 다른 방법을 사용할 때 기본 자동 노출 동작이 다르게 구성되어 자동 노출 동작이 일관되지 않을 수 있습니다.",
      "sourceHash": "2032dc067eceac75b1a6c1890fc7a53f1d29c742b6f9ddbc0c6f16af4fbc8d75",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0002",
      "source": "Auto exposure defaults include [`minFrameRate`](avframeraterange/minframerate.md), [`maxFrameRate`](avframeraterange/maxframerate.md), and [`maxExposureDuration`](avcapturedevice/format/maxexposureduration.md).",
      "ko": "자동 노출 기본 설정에는 [`minFrameRate`](avframeraterange/minframerate.md), [`maxFrameRate`](avframeraterange/maxframerate.md), [`maxExposureDuration`](avcapturedevice/format/maxexposureduration.md)가 포함됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "1c25e0ad7d506877db1774e36779ece90b236304609829c9cd4940e513c36f89",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0003",
      "source": "You can set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true) to ensure that the system applies consistent default behaviors to the device regardless of the way you set the active format.",
      "ko": "이 속성을 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정하면 활성 형식을 설정하는 방식과 상관없이 시스템이 장치에 일관된 기본 동작을 적용합니다.",
      "sourceHash": "ed5e3bc342a9bb996852afb1d52c249475e5c40f9d4194b23b45880f0f1a8db3",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0011:0001",
      "source": "The default value is [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false).",
      "ko": "기본값은 [`false`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/false)입니다.",
      "sourceHash": "d4420af4c56a26d1c0593948897f598ceded48c9146427e6c08c3ddafbd53d0d",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
    {
      "id": "seg:blockquote:discussion:0012:0001",
      "source": "**Note**: Manually setting the device’s [`minFrameRate`](avframeraterange/minframerate.md), [`maxFrameRate`](avframeraterange/maxframerate.md), or [`maxExposureDuration`](avcapturedevice/format/maxexposureduration.md) overrides the device defaults, even if you set this property to [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true).",
      "ko": "**Note**: 이 속성을 [`true`](https://developer.apple.com/documentation/Swift/true)로 설정했더라도 장치의 [`minFrameRate`](avframeraterange/minframerate.md), [`maxFrameRate`](avframeraterange/maxframerate.md), [`maxExposureDuration`](avcapturedevice/format/maxexposureduration.md)를 수동으로 설정하면 장치 기본값이 덮어쓰기됩니다.",
      "sourceHash": "60cf0abc37453a3be51a69e30a65b4beeddbf172e0f80dd2bd3f3ddbd6f6c39a",
      "status": "machine_translated"
    },
